    **Rules version:** 0.11.0-rc.7-test
    **Design-baseline date:** July 26, 2026
    **Status:** Controlled playtest candidate; synchronized with executable game 0.19.5
    **Provisional time:** 75–100 minutes at four players; three- and five-player durations require their own blind tests
    **Standard game:** Four Eras, three turns per player per Era
    
